[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9661.23, "timestamp": "02:41:01", "text": "分钟。是的，那是10"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9664.59, "timestamp": "02:41:04", "text": "分钟。那么，让我们结束今天的讨论吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9667.91, "timestamp": "02:41:07", "text": "寻求。我们需要完成这个任务。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9669.87, "timestamp": "02:41:09", "text": "我要去实地考察。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9672.11, "timestamp": "02:41:12", "text": "老板。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9680.71, "timestamp": "02:41:20", "text": "哦，它9分钟后就会出现。好的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9683.87, "timestamp": "02:41:23", "text": "我应该把这件事做完。让我穿上我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9686.39, "timestamp": "02:41:26", "text": "眼镜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9689.07, "timestamp": "02:41:29", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9693.07, "timestamp": "02:41:33", "text": "等等，等等，我刚才说到哪儿了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9703.03, "timestamp": "02:41:43", "text": "忘了。我完全忘记了。我当时是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9706.349, "timestamp": "02:41:46", "text": "在说什么？我的“哪里”的声音在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9708.19, "timestamp": "02:41:48", "text": "仪表？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9711.87, "timestamp": "02:41:51", "text": "嗯，我的声音呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9713.55, "timestamp": "02:41:53", "text": "仪表？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9717.95, "timestamp": "02:41:57", "text": "嗯，哦，任务完成了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9719.87, "timestamp": "02:41:59", "text": "好的。"}]